<title>CHILE: Chile's Edelnor 1996 net plunges.</title>
<headline>Chile's Edelnor 1996 net plunges.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chilean power generator Compania Electrica del Norte Grande, Edelnor, reported the following 1996 results.</p>
<p>				 1996	     1995</p>
<p>Net profit		   0.12   profit  3.39</p>
<p>Operating profit	   2.05   profit  2.92</p>
<p>Non-operating loss	 1.60   profit  1.22</p>
<p>Total revenues		N/A		N/A</p>
<p>NOTE: 1. All figures are in billions of pesos.</p>
<p>2. Southern Co owns 65 percent of Edelnor.</p>
<p>(( --Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
